[{"id":164977266,"discussion_id":"92c4bd446b411ac22847de0567a242fb23c19baa","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| index | ✅ [*fanqirui*](https://gitcode.com/fanqirui), [*zhou-qilong*](https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong) (2/2) | ✅ [*zhou-qilong*](https://gitcode.com/zhou-qilong) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)","created_at":"2026-03-11T20:18:37+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-13T14:58:43+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164977289,"discussion_id":"666ceeea660f00b5412a38754df78d022f46fb46","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-11T20:18:46+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-11T20:18:46+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164977317,"discussion_id":"94a6c290a0ae514ebeb17cc3e9d20a7a860ba024","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR旨在优化确定性原地索引加法（InplaceIndexAddDeterminstic）内核的性能与正确性。主要解决了两个问题：一是优化路径中`sumIdxQue_`缓冲区内存分配过大，导致内存利用率低；二是`CopyInverseQuantizedValueOutOpti`函数内缺少必要的硬件同步事件，存在数据竞争风险。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案包含两项核心优化：首先，在`ProcessThirdStepOpti`函数中，将`sumIdxQue_`缓冲区大小从`rowMainDataLen * afterAxisAlignSize_ * sizeof(IDX_T)`缩减为`rowMainDataLen * sizeof(IDX_T)`，显著降低了内存占用。其次，在`CopyInverseQuantizedValueOutOpti`函数中，在`Muls`缩放操作后增加了`V_MTE3`硬件事件的设置与等待，确保了向量计算单元与内存传输引擎间的正确同步。此外，修正了`CopyRValueAndIntWsAndIndexInOpti`函数中的变量拼写错误，并使用正确的分块因子`tilingData_.ubVarOptiFactor`。","created_at":"2026-03-11T20:19:04+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-11T20:19:04+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165067855,"discussion_id":"4f6909e0d22806c0edb5e4947ffee8f3874df6fc","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-12T16:39:24+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-12T16:39:24+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165071014,"discussion_id":"ae80419548452e4d00496395dfb8a2dfbaa4eed1","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-12T16